    "type": "game",
    "name": "Dragomir: The Dreaming",
    "steam_appid": 3785520,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dragomir: The Dreaming</i></strong><br><i>In the beginning, there was only the Breath\u2026 and from it, all realms were born.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before stars lit the sky, the <strong>Great Winged Mother</strong> and <strong>Orrann</strong>, force of Light, shaped <strong>Dragomir</strong> from the void. A land where elements thrived, life stirred, and shadow waited. Out of a long-forgotten conflict, the <strong>Dytann</strong>\u2014elemental wolves\u2014were created to defend the fragile Dream. You are <strong>Rehocca</strong>, one such wolf, called to uncover ancient truths and confront a growing darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>old-school high fantasy adventure</strong>, the world is vast, beautiful, and alive with mystery. The Dreaming is just the beginning\u2014a gateway into an epic yet to unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is no passive tale. <strong>You will shape it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> sprawling environments\u2014from towering ruins and verdant glades to elemental caverns and skybridges.<br><strong>Quest</strong> across branching storylines\u2014meet ancient beings, aid struggling villages, and face corrupted foes.<br><strong>Craft</strong> your survival\u2014gather ingredients, prepare nourishing food, and create enchanted items.<br>Engage in <strong>combat</strong>, both <strong>melee</strong> and <strong>magical</strong>\u2014master elemental strikes and defensive techniques as you battle shadow-touched creatures.<br>Solve <strong>jumping puzzles</strong> and uncover secret pathways where only the nimblest wolves may tread.<br><strong>Collect</strong> lore fragments, rare artifacts, and in-game <strong>achievements</strong> that deepen your connection to the world\u2019s history.<br><strong>Level up</strong> Rehocca\u2019s powers\u2014unlock new abilities like higher level spells and crafting, and evolve your combat style.<br><strong>Save your progress</strong> anytime, allowing for <strong>family-friendly</strong> play\u2014perfect for casual exploration or deep, lore-driven sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step uncovers lost memories, reshapes your path, and weaves you deeper into the Dreaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragomir: The Dreaming</strong> invites you to an experience of discovery, challenge, and wonder. As the first chapter of a greater saga, it offers both adventure and a beginning\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now the Breath stirs again.<br>Will you answer the call?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dragomir: The Dreaming</i></strong><br><i>In the beginning, there was only the Breath\u2026 and from it, all realms were born.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before stars lit the sky, the <strong>Great Winged Mother</strong> and <strong>Orrann</strong>, force of Light, shaped <strong>Dragomir</strong> from the void. A land where elements thrived, life stirred, and shadow waited. Out of a long-forgotten conflict, the <strong>Dytann</strong>\u2014elemental wolves\u2014were created to defend the fragile Dream. You are <strong>Rehocca</strong>, one such wolf, called to uncover ancient truths and confront a growing darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>old-school high fantasy adventure</strong>, the world is vast, beautiful, and alive with mystery. The Dreaming is just the beginning\u2014a gateway into an epic yet to unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is no passive tale. <strong>You will shape it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> sprawling environments\u2014from towering ruins and verdant glades to elemental caverns and skybridges.<br><strong>Quest</strong> across branching storylines\u2014meet ancient beings, aid struggling villages, and face corrupted foes.<br><strong>Craft</strong> your survival\u2014gather ingredients, prepare nourishing food, and create enchanted items.<br>Engage in <strong>combat</strong>, both <strong>melee</strong> and <strong>magical</strong>\u2014master elemental strikes and defensive techniques as you battle shadow-touched creatures.<br>Solve <strong>jumping puzzles</strong> and uncover secret pathways where only the nimblest wolves may tread.<br><strong>Collect</strong> lore fragments, rare artifacts, and in-game <strong>achievements</strong> that deepen your connection to the world\u2019s history.<br><strong>Level up</strong> Rehocca\u2019s powers\u2014unlock new abilities like higher level spells and crafting, and evolve your combat style.<br><strong>Save your progress</strong> anytime, allowing for <strong>family-friendly</strong> play\u2014perfect for casual exploration or deep, lore-driven sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step uncovers lost memories, reshapes your path, and weaves you deeper into the Dreaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragomir: The Dreaming</strong> invites you to an experience of discovery, challenge, and wonder. As the first chapter of a greater saga, it offers both adventure and a beginning\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now the Breath stirs again.<br>Will you answer the call?</p>",
    "short_description": "Dragomir: The Dreaming \u2014 Play as R\u00e9hocca, an elemental Dytann wolf, in a high fantasy world shaped by ancient myth. Guided by The Dreaming, explore sacred lands, uncover lost truths, and face the rising darkness of the Moldering. The first breath of a greater epic begins.",
